"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Do a role play of a mock interview ..."}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "000", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le10ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ummm. This coffee is good.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Yes, and this dessert is delicious too. Peter what are you doing?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That bite of your cake was so amazing that I decided to get one of my own.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: So, Vanessa. It's your turn to tell a story. I want to know how you became the manager at Bistro 88.</br >", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le10ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "19000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure. When I first came in, Bill Williams was running the place. Did you ever meet Bill, Peter?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, I never met Bill.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Bill had made a lot of money on the stockmarket. He made so much money that he decided to open his own restaurant. The problem was, Bill and his partners didn't know anything about running a restaurant. He lacked the  insight and the tenacity needed to make things work in the restaurant business.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Was he a nice guy?</br >", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le10ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "45500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh he was a great guy, but he didn't know how to organize employees and he didn't know what to give customers. At one point, he created such turmoil that half of his staff quit on him.  When I first walked into the kitchen, several people were busily cooking, some were preparing food, some weren't doing anything, the chef was yelling, and customers were waiting to be helped. One customer was yelling at a server and waving his hands. Others were complaining to each other about the bad service. Soon after that, it was such a disorganized mess that most of the chefs quit and because I was still there I got promoted to head chef. After a month, Bill confided in me that he didn't want to run the place anymore. He just wanted to own it and asked me if I wanted to manage it and I said yes.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: You were able to turn things around that quickly?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, we treaded water for about six months while I implemented my vision for the place. Bill was willing to spend some money so that we could hire some hot young chefs. We got a few good reviews and through social media and a lot of hard work, we were able to get the word out.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Huh? I never knew that. So are we going to play some games?</br >", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le10ob07re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le10ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le10ob07re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}